Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.05,TL,,0,0,0,,重打一分 孙心然留下遗憾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:06.31,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}5{\fs68}号晚 中网第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.31,0:00:07.98,TL,,0,0,0,,重打一分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.64,0:00:10.89,TL,,0,0,0,,当时孙心然首盘{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.89,0:00:13.44,TL,,0,0,0,,高芙发球 小分{\fs78}15{\fs68}平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.44,0:00:14.89,TL,,0,0,0,,孙心然打出好球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.89,0:00:17.95,TL,,0,0,0,,原本会让高芙变成{\fs78}15{\fs68}比{\fs78}30{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:20.42,TL,,0,0,0,,注意 这还不是盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:22.96,TL,,0,0,0,,侧边{\fs78}LED{\fs68}在回合中闪动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:24.83,TL,,0,0,0,,回看后判重打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.83,0:00:26.37,TL,,0,0,0,,比分退回{\fs78}15{\fs68}平
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.37,0:00:28.91,TL,,0,0,0,,重打高芙赢分并保发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.91,0:00:32.54,TL,,0,0,0,,孙心然最终{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} {\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}告负
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.74,0:00:34.97,TL,,0,0,0,,按规则 外部干扰成立
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.97,0:00:36.41,TL,,0,0,0,,要把整分从头来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.41,0:00:38.18,TL,,0,0,0,,发球也回到一发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.18,0:00:40.54,TL,,0,0,0,,这不是判高芙直接得分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.54,0:00:43.35,TL,,0,0,0,,对手故意妨碍 才判对手丢分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.35,0:00:46.30,TL,,0,0,0,,不构成妨碍 则原得分有效
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:50.98,TL,,0,0,0,,视频回看核查干扰 不是判断落点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.98,0:00:52.71,TL,,0,0,0,,申请时机是否合法
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.71,0:00:55.48,TL,,0,0,0,,仍要看中网的具体程序
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:00:57.88,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年罗马
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.88,0:00:59.55,TL,,0,0,0,,安德列娃的制胜球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.55,0:01:01.78,TL,,0,0,0,,也因灯突然开启重打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.78,0:01:04.53,TL,,0,0,0,,她当时落泪 后来赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:08.04,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The lights were turned on{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N灯打开了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:09.70,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}before Andreeva hit the ball{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在安德列娃击球之前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:12.20,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That means there was a hindrance{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这意味着出现了干扰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:14.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}We will replay the point{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一分需要重打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.30,0:01:16.25,TL,,0,0,0,,主办方当然要负责
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.25,0:01:17.96,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}WTA{\fs68}明确要求
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:20.94,TL,,0,0,0,,球员准备发球后 广告不得变化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.94,0:01:21.91,TL,,0,0,0,,重打一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.91,0:01:25.43,TL,,0,0,0,,不能把赛事方的保障责任一笔勾销
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.22,0:01:28.79,TL,,0,0,0,,侧边广告可以在两分之间换
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:30.33,TL,,0,0,0,,底线后面的广告
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.33,0:01:32.67,TL,,0,0,0,,只能在一局结束后换
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.67,0:01:34.13,TL,,0,0,0,,两种位置都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.13,0:01:37.45,TL,,0,0,0,,球员准备发球以后 必须保持稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.65,0:01:40.43,TL,,0,0,0,,赛事违规可警告 罚款
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.43,0:01:43.69,TL,,0,0,0,,但本场是否处罚 尚无结论
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:46.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}War bitter enttäuscht{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她非常失望
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.76,0:01:48.94,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}nach dem ersten Satz, Sun Xinran,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N首盘结束后的孙心然
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.94,0:01:49.96,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}die sich erst mal{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她先
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:50.98,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}die Tränen trocknen musste.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N擦去了眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.09,0:01:53.58,TL,,0,0,0,,孙心然自己说 那一局有机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.58,0:01:55.90,TL,,0,0,0,,却因为自己的原因没拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.90,0:01:59.32,TL,,0,0,0,,看着机会流失 情绪有些崩溃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.52,0:02:02.71,TL,,0,0,0,,她还说 第二盘情绪受到影响
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.16,0:02:05.58,TL,,0,0,0,,下一次 会更好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.85,0:02:07.18,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So I'm looking forward{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N所以我很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.18,0:02:08.65,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}to the future matchups we have.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N未来与她再次交手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.82,0:02:12.32,TL,,0,0,0,,比分能重置 感觉未必能一起退回去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:14.07,TL,,0,0,0,,期待更可靠的赛场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:16.91,TL,,0,0,0,,也期待她握住下一次机会
